cups

# ── fonts ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
ttf-dejavu
ttf-liberation
noto-fonts
noto-fonts-emoji
noto-fonts-cjk
# NOT noto-fonts-extra (removed 2026-10-01). 331.3 MiB for one package, and it adds no
# SCRIPT this image could not already render: measured against the Artix file database, all
# 84 font families in noto-fonts-extra are among the 226 in noto-fonts, and what it adds is
# extra WIDTHS and WEIGHTS of them (Condensed / SemiCondensed / ExtraCondensed, and a couple
# of Semibold faces). noto-fonts, noto-fonts-cjk and noto-fonts-emoji keep the coverage.
